                                          "id":  "ne2-intro",
                                          "title":  "Purpose of this page",
                                          "query":  "## PREC_AL7075 - the only fully computed example\n\nNew production vs. repair, the ten EN15804/EF3.1 indicators from the black-box AAS, and the underlying material/energy flows - everything computed for real, nothing estimated.",
